msgstr "طلب الموظفين يضم الموظفين المطلوبين فقط."

#. module: KSW_employee_transfer
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_employee_transfer/models/ksw_employee_request.py:0
msgid "A submitted request is not changed: the GM decides it as sent."
msgstr "لا يُعدّل الطلب بعد رفعه: يبت فيه المدير العام كما رُفع."

#. module: KSW_employee_transfer
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_employee_transfer/models/ksw_employee_transfer.py:0
msgid ""
"A transfer comes from a GM decision: release the employee, or request "
"employees, and the GM matches them."
msgstr ""
"النقل يأتي من قرار المدير العام: استغنِ عن الموظف أو اطلب موظفين، والمدير "
"العام يطابق بينهما."

#. module: KSW_employee_transfer
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_employee_transfer/models/ksw_employee_transfer.py:0
msgid "A transfer is cancelled or returned to the GM, never deleted."
msgstr "يُلغى النقل أو يُعاد إلى المدير العام، ولا يُحذف."

#. module: KSW_employee_transfer
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/KSW_employee_transfer/models/ksw_employee_transfer.py:0
msgid "A transfer is completed by HR, only while it is with HR."
msgstr "تستكمل الموارد البشرية النقل، فقط وهو لديها."

#. module: KSW_employee_transfer
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:KSW_employee_transfer.action_ksw_employee_transfer
msgid ""
"A transfer starts when the GM gives a released employee to another "
"department's request. HR completes it and it takes effect on its date."
msgstr ""
"يبدأ النقل عندما يعطي المدير العام موظفاً مستغنى عنه لطلب قسم آخر. تستكمله "
"الموارد البشرية ويسري في تاريخه."

